# Version bump on every change

After finishing any user-facing code change in this Flutter app (before commit/push/build):

1. Bump `pubspec.yaml` `version:` — increase **build number** every time (`+N` → `+N+1`).
2. For meaningful fixes/features, also bump **patch** (e.g. `3.8.4+243` → `3.8.5+244`).
3. Include the version bump in the same commit as the change (or immediately after), so CI artifacts are identifiable.
4. Mention the new version (e.g. `3.8.4+243`) when telling the user builds are ready.
